{
    "manifest": {
        "Help": "Ayuda",
        "Help and user guide for Hubleto.": "Ayuda y guía del usuario para Hubleto.",
        "\r\n        Go to <a href=\"customers\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Customers<\/span><\/a>\r\n        app and click <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Add customer<\/span><\/button> to add your first customer.\r\n      ": "",
        "\r\n        Open your <a href=\"customers\/1\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">first customer<\/span><\/a>\r\n        or open <a href=\"contacts\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Contacts<\/span><\/a> app\r\n        and add <u>primary<\/u> contact for this customer.\r\n      ": "",
        "\r\n        Change <a href=\"workflow\/workflows\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">default workflows<\/span><\/a>\r\n        if you need to.\r\n      ": "",
        "\r\n        Create a <a href=\"deals\/add\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Deal<\/span><\/a>\r\n        and assign it to your customer. Do not forget to set the deal's workflow.\r\n      ": "",
        "\r\n        Track the progress of your deal in <a href=\"workflow\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Workflow<\/span><\/a> app.\r\n      ": "",
        "\r\n        Plan follow-ups for the deal to win it. <a href=\"deals\/1\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Open the deal<\/span><\/a>\r\n        and go to <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Calendar<\/span><\/button> tab. Schedule an\r\n        activity there.\r\n      ": "",
        "\r\n        You won the deal! Now, <a href=\"deals\/1\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">open the deal<\/span><\/a> and\r\n        click <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Create order<\/span><\/button> to create an order from this deal.\r\n      ": "",
        "\r\n        If you need to track time spent on the order, <a href=\"orders\/1\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">open the order<\/span><\/a> and click\r\n        <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Create project<\/span><\/button>.\r\n        Then create a task.\r\n      ": "",
        "\r\n        Go to <a href=\"worksheets\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Worksheets<\/span><\/a>\r\n        app and click <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Add activity<\/span><\/button> to track your time.\r\n      ": "",
        "\r\n        You did the job. Now it is time to issue an invoice. Open the deal, go to <i>Items<\/i>\r\n        tab, create the item and click <i>Prepare for invoice<\/i>. Then go to <i>Invoices<\/i>\r\n        app and create the invoice.\r\n      ": "",
        "\r\n          <div><b>Learn Hubleto in few steps<\/b><\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"mt-2 step\">t(hubleto-app-community-help-loader:manifest; \r\n        Go to <a href=\"customers\" class=\"btn btn-white\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text\">Customers<\/span><\/a>\r\n        app and click <button class=\"btn btn-white\"><span class=\"text\">Add customer<\/span><\/button> to add your first customer.\r\n      )<\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"mt-2\">\r\n            <button\r\n              class=\"btn btn-white\"\r\n              onclick=\"\r\n                let t = $(this);\r\n                $.getJSON(\r\n                  'help\/api\/welcome-guide-previous-step',\r\n                  function(data, status) {\r\n                    let html = '';\r\n                    if (data.html == '') {\r\n                      html = 'Well done. 👍 You are now ready to start using Hubleto.';\r\n                    } else {\r\n                      html = data.html;\r\n                    }\r\n                    t.closest('.content').find('.step').html(html);\r\n                  }\r\n                );\r\n              \"\r\n            > \r\n              <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-left\"><\/i><\/span>\r\n              <span class=\"text\">Previous<\/span>\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            <button\r\n              class=\"btn btn-white\"\r\n              onclick=\"\r\n                let t = $(this);\r\n                $.getJSON(\r\n                  'help\/api\/welcome-guide-next-step',\r\n                  function(data, status) {\r\n                    let html = '';\r\n                    if (data.html == '') {\r\n                      html = 'Well done. 👍 You are now ready to start using Hubleto.';\r\n                    } else {\r\n                      html = data.html;\r\n                    }\r\n                    t.closest('.content').find('.step').html(html);\r\n                  }\r\n                );\r\n              \"\r\n            >\r\n              <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\"><\/i><\/span>\r\n              <span class=\"text\">Next<\/span>\r\n            <\/button>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        ": ""
    },
    "Controllers\\Help": {
        "Help center": "Centro de ayuda",
        "Search knowledgebase...": "Buscar en la base de conocimientos...",
        "Browse knowledgebase": "Explorar la base de conocimientos",
        "Need help using Hubleto?": "¿Necesitas ayuda para usar Hubleto?",
        "Found a bug?": "¿Encontraste un error?",
        "Need help with development?": "¿Necesitas ayuda con el desarrollo?",
        "Just looking around?": "¿Solo estás mirando alrededor?",
        "Help": "Ayuda",
        "About your Hubleto": "Acerca de tu Hubleto"
    },
    "Controllers\\Search": {
        "Help": "Ayuda",
        "Search": "Buscar",
        "Bring search to the brand new level.": "Lleve la búsqueda a un nivel completamente nuevo.",
        "Hubleto fulltext search provides powerful functionality to enhance search capabilities.": "La búsqueda de texto completo de Hubleto ofrece funciones potentes para mejorar las capacidades de búsqueda.",
        "Ctrl+K shortcut": "Atajo Ctrl+K",
        "Type {ctrlK} to start searching at any time.": "Presione {ctrlK} para empezar a buscar en cualquier momento.",
        "App selectors": "Selectores de aplicación",
        "{appSelectors} are special tags like, e.g. {codeExample}, filtering what app should be used to search. Using app selectors makes search faster and more effective because it directly points to a certain app and ignores searching in other apps.": "Los {appSelectors} son etiquetas especiales, por ejemplo {codeExample}, que filtran qué aplicación se debe usar para buscar. Usar selectores de aplicación hace la búsqueda más rápida y efectiva, porque apunta directamente a una aplicación concreta e ignora la búsqueda en las demás.",
        "Example:": "Ejemplo:",
        "will invoke search in {dealsApp} app with expression {expression}.": "buscará en la aplicación {dealsApp} con la expresión {expression}.",
        "The app selectors are intuitive, try using {contacts} or {tasks}.": "Los selectores de aplicación son intuitivos, pruebe a usar {contacts} o {tasks}.",
        "Switches": "Modificadores",
        "{switches} behave a bit differently from {appSelectors}. By providing a switch (e.g, {codeExample}), you may directly specify, what kind of data you want to search. One switch may be assigned with more than one app.": "Los {switches} se comportan de forma un poco distinta a los {appSelectors}. Al indicar un modificador (por ejemplo, {codeExample}), puede especificar directamente qué tipo de datos desea buscar. Un modificador puede estar asignado a más de una aplicación.",
        "will search for tasks (or related data) across the whole Hubleto, containing identifier {identifier}.": "buscará tareas (o datos relacionados) en todo Hubleto que contengan el identificador {identifier}.",
        "Switches can have their shorthand variants, e.g. {short} is equal to {long}.": "Los modificadores pueden tener variantes abreviadas, por ejemplo {short} equivale a {long}."
    }
}